fixture dash_cancels_down_strike
doc BUILD.md s5 Dash "Dash cancels any attack after frame 4 of that attack" applied to the down-strike, whose Taper row lists only "Anything on bounce" (docs/adr/0010)
room test/flat
spawn 400 300
frames 30
input
  0 D attack
  # A mistimed down-strike: the dash pressed on its frame 2 waits for frame 4 and takes over.
  1 R dash
end
expect
  at 0 action=down action_frame=1
  never 1..2 event.dash=1
  at 3 event.dash=1 action=none state=dash vx=5120 vy=0
end
